t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌正式发布 Gemini Omni 模型，实现文本音频图像视频多模态实时交互</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面完成20亿美元融资并拆除红筹架构，正式启动赴港IPO进程</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合创始人Andrej Karpathy正式加盟Anthropic，投身下一代LLM研发</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴发布真武M890芯片及128卡超节点服务器，实现百纳秒级通信时延</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/66eb33fc0b7a17b95d2eb21bbdc1c39a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴在2026阿里云峰会上正式发布基于平头哥新一代AI芯片“真武M890”的128卡超节点服务器。该系统搭载平头哥自研的ICN Switch1.0互联芯片，通过创新的超节点架构，将128张AI芯片融合成一台高效协同的超级计算机，实现了百纳秒级的芯片间超低通信时延。该服务器专为Agentic（智能体）时代设计，旨在应对极致算力挑战，未来将重点服务于海量Agent并发推理及大模型训练等核心业务场景。此次发布标志着阿里在底层算力基础设施领域的进一步突破，通过降低互联时延，显著提升了大规模集群的协同效率，为处理复杂智能体任务提供了更强劲的硬件支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">通义实验室发布Qwen3.7-Max大模型，引入正交解耦技术提升Agent稳定性</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ceebdfcbec3ff731e17fdaba0c48808e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">通义实验室正式发布新一代AI Agent基座大模型Qwen3.7-Max，通过独创的“任务-运行框架-验证器”正交解耦设计，解决模型对特定框架过拟合的行业痛点。在ZW-M890L PPU硬件平台的极限压力测试中，该模型实现连续运行35小时、跨越1158次工具调用零中断，并在多项工作负载中取得10.0倍的几何平均加速。Qwen3.7-Max支持模型上下文协议（MCP），集成office-cli等生产力工具，并具备多智能体编排与具身智能操控扩展能力。该模型即将上线阿里云百炼平台，全面对齐OpenAI与Anthropic API协议，实现与Claude Code、OpenClaw及Qwen Code等主流框架的即插即用集成。此次发布标志着AI Agent在复杂分布式产业工作流中的工程化落地能力显著增强，为高可靠性自动</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌正式发布 Gemini Omni 模型，实现文本音频图像视频多模态实时交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于5月19日正式发布Gemini模型家族最新成员Gemini Omni，该模型核心在于提升多模态技术的处理能力，旨在实现更流畅自然的跨模态交互体验。Gemini Omni具备同时理解与处理文本、音频、图像及视频的能力，用户在输入语音提问时，模型可实时识别需求并结合图片、视频内容提供反馈。谷歌官方表示，Gemini Omni在处理速度、准确性及实时性方面均有显著提升。这一技术的突破将大幅优化人机交互效率，为教育、娱乐及商业等领域的AI应用提供更直观、及时的反馈机制，预示着多模态AI在实际场景中的应用潜力将进一步释放。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面完成20亿美元融资并拆除红筹架构，正式启动赴港IPO进程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/771388504ca418bb53c19b1e1546d63c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面（Moonshot AI）近日完成约20亿美元新一轮融资，投后估值突破200亿美元，并已正式启动公司架构重整，通过拆除“红筹架构”为赴港上市铺路。此次调整旨在响应境内企业赴境外上市的监管新规，确保经营实体符合合规要求。知情人士透露，月之暗面将采用“合资企业”等结构安排，确保现有美元基金及外资股东无需撤资，实现资本结构的平稳过渡。作为国内AI大模型领军企业，月之暗面凭借Kimi智能助手等产品迅速崛起。此次架构重组不仅是其合规转型的关键举措，也标志着公司正式进入资本市场化运作阶段，旨在通过登陆港股加速AGI（通用人工智能）领域的算力储备与研发投入。该动作被视为国内AI独角兽探索境外上市路径的重要风向标，市场正密切关注其后续在香港资本市场的挂牌进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合创始人Andrej Karpathy正式加盟Anthropic，投身下一代LLM研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc5db650b5a3f0f9c43f7a2e50eb5934.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI联合创始人、前特斯拉自动驾驶负责人Andrej Karpathy正式宣布加入Anthropic，将专注于大型语言模型（LLM）的底层架构与深层集成研究。Karpathy曾主导特斯拉视觉导航系统开发，此次履新后，他将继续探索“LLM作为新型计算机操作系统”的愿景，推动模型从对话交互向系统级底座演进。Anthropic目前凭借Claude 3系列模型（Haiku、Sonnet、Opus）及Claude 3.5 Sonnet在编码与视觉理解领域展现出极强竞争力。此次顶级人才的引入，不仅为Anthropic注入了卓越的工程实现能力，更被视为硅谷AI权力格局重塑的关键信号。随着GPT-5与Claude后续版本的竞争加剧，Karpathy的加入有望加速大模型从单纯规模扩张向系统化、垂直化集成的范式转型，进一步缩</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
